(SFX: heartbeat beep, frantic radio chatter)

SCENE 11 (11.2–12.4s) — Weapon Jam Moment

Soldier slams rifle — it jams.
Alien limb slides into frame — soldier calmly switches weapon.

(SFX: click → metallic snap)

